# Build context of infra/airflow/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file instead of the
# root .dockerignore for that Dockerfile). The context is the repository root.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/**
!transform/**
transform/target
transform/logs
!orchestration/dags/**
!infra/airflow/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
